  "releaseNotes": "XSLT 4.0 ordered maps: xsl:map, map constructors, records, and JSON-object maps now iterate in entry/insertion order as a structural guarantee (backed by the engine's OrderedXdmMap, requires PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.3). Grouping into a map emits groups in first-seen order, matching the XML-target equivalent — no \"don't rely on it\" caveat.\n      469/469 XSLT tests green. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
